{
 "name": "R1-01",
 "note": "bea accepts the invitation twice (acc1, acc2; acc2 sees acc1). ann stops the invitation having seen acc1 but not acc2. Core: bea is removed in every order. Oracle: removed only when acc1 is met before acc2; with acc2 first the stop is read as having not seen the answer and bea \"never joined\". The oracle takes the first accept it meets (answerTo, fb.cjs:1644, used at :1650), so the choice follows arrival order; the same applies to every later use of the answer in circleFold. Blocks of args are held in the order named.",
